# Peters & May Brand Guidelines v2.0 (July 2026)

Working draft Group policy. Supersedes February 2016. Owner: Group Marketing — marketing@petersandmay.com.

## Promise and voice

- Promise: "We bring experienced thinking to complex logistics" — positioning line, not a logo strapline.
- Principles: expertise, consultation, foresight, control, confidence.
- Voice: British English; consultative, specific, unhurried; active voice; short sentences.
- "Peters & May" with ampersand, in full on first mention. "P&M" internally / file names only.
- Avoid: hype, superlatives, exclamation marks, emoji, "seamless", "solutions provider", "world-class", "revolutionary".
- Never invent clients, quotes, case studies, or company figures — leave factsheet placeholders.

## Architecture

One brand, three divisions (four lock-ups). No new brands without Group approval.

1. Peters & May — Bespoke Logistics (corporate default)
2. Peters & May Global Yacht Transport
3. Peters & May Global Freight Forwarding
4. Peters & May Commercial Marine Transport

CEC Couriers is separately branded. Netherlands lock-up is legacy — do not use in new templates.

## Colour (hub tokens in `marketing-hub-v2/src/lib/brand/tokens.ts`)

- Ensign Navy `#0B2545` — primary brand
- Deep Navy `#071A2E` · Slate Navy `#1B3A5B`
- P&M Blue `#007DC5` — single accent
- White / Mist `#E3E6E9` — working surfaces and quiet fills
- Ensign Red `#ED1C24` — **logo artwork only**, never a layout colour
- Status colours: approved digital greens/ambers/greys + a word or symbol; not brand red

## Typography

- League Spartan — headlines / titles / social
- Archivo — body, labels, tables, interface
- Arial — operational documents and email fallback
- PT Sans is in the logo only — never retype the wordmark

## Logo

Clear space = height of the ampersand. Never stretch, rotate, recolour, add effects, or rebuild. Request artwork from marketing.

## AI / imagery

- AI may draft; human review before publish/client send.
- Never present generated imagery as real Peters & May work, vessels, ports, or people.
- Do not enter confidential client/vessel/rate/contract detail into unapproved tools.
- Hub paste-ready summary: `marketing-hub-v2/src/lib/brand/ai-summary.ts`
